# Data Flow Diagram — Obsidian Shared Memory Bus

## Write Path

```mermaid
flowchart LR
    subgraph WRITE["WRITE PATH"]
        direction TB
        W1["<b>Step 1</b><br/>Agent writes note<br/>to inbox/&lt;agent&gt;.md"]
        W2["<b>Step 2</b><br/>Watchdog detects<br/>file-change signature drift"]
        W3["<b>Step 3</b><br/>memory-bus.ps1 -Action SyncAll<br/>scans all native sources"]
        W4["<b>Step 4</b><br/>build-memory-layers.js<br/>builds MEMORY-LAYERS artifact"]
        W5["<b>Step 5</b><br/>entity-extractor.js<br/>extracts facts[] + concepts[]"]
        W6["<b>Step 6</b><br/>knowledge-graph.js<br/>stores KG triples in SQLite"]
        W7["<b>Step 7</b><br/>structured JSONL files<br/>written to 00-System/ai-memory/"]
        W8["<b>Step 8</b><br/>generate-embeddings.js<br/>updates embeddings/index.jsonl"]
        W9["<b>Step 9</b><br/>GLOBAL-CONTEXT.md<br/>refreshed for session bootstrap"]
    end

    W1 --> W2 --> W3 --> W4 --> W5 --> W6
    W3 -->|"writes JSONL"| W7
    W4 -->|"writes"| W9
    W5 -->|"appends facts/entities"| W7
    W7 --> W8
```

### Write Path: Detail

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant A as Agent
    participant OBS as Obsidian Vault<br/>(inbox/)
    participant WD as Watchdog
    participant MB as memory-bus.ps1
    participant BML as build-memory-layers.js
    participant EE as entity-extractor.js
    participant KG as knowledge-graph.js
    participant GEN as generate-embeddings.js
    participant STR as structured/*.jsonl
    participant EMB as embeddings/index.jsonl

    A->>OBS: Write inbox/&lt;agent&gt;.md
    OBS-->>WD: File change event (chokidar/polling)

    loop Every 15s (configurable)
        WD->>MB: Invoke-BusSync
        MB->>STR: SyncAll: update JSONL from all sources
        MB->>BML: Trigger structured refresh pipeline
        BML->>STR: Read structured JSONL
        BML->>GEN: Signal structured changed
        BML->>EE: Trigger entity extraction
        EE->>STR: Append facts[] + concepts[] to records
        EE->>KG: Store KG triples (entity, relation, entity)
        KG->>STR: Read records for KG enrichment

        alt Idle 15min + accumulation threshold
            MB->>GEN: Rebuild embeddings (cooldown 180s)
            GEN->>EMB: BM25 + dense index update
        end
    end

    MB->>OBS: Refresh GLOBAL-CONTEXT.md
```

## Read Path

```mermaid
flowchart TB
    subgraph READ["READ PATH"]
        direction TB
        R1["<b>Step 1</b><br/>Agent sends query via MCP"]
        R2["<b>Step 2</b><br/>omni-memory-server.js<br/>receives search_shared_memory"]
        R3["<b>Step 3</b><br/>semantic-search.py<br/>metadata filter (SQLite)"]
        R4["<b>Step 4</b><br/>Parallel: BM25 + Dense search"]
        R5["<b>Step 5</b><br/>Hybrid merge + MMR + rerank"]
        R6["<b>Step 6</b><br/>Results with path + snippet + score"]
        R7["<b>Step 7</b><br/>Context returned to agent"]
    end

    R1 --> R2 --> R3 --> R4 --> R5 --> R6 --> R7
```

```mermaid
flowchart LR
    subgraph QUERY["AGENT QUERY"]
        Q["search_shared_memory<br/>(query, route, limit)"]
    end

    subgraph STAGE1["Stage 1: Metadata Filter"]
        META["SQLite filter<br/>memory_type, archived=false,<br/>expires_at > now"]
    end

    subgraph STAGE2["Stage 2: Parallel Retrieval"]
        BM25["BM25 / FTS5<br/>(always available)<br/>rank_bm25 + jieba"]
        DENSE["Dense Vector<br/>(needs provider)<br/>hashing-v1 / Ollama / OpenAI"]
    end

    subgraph STAGE3["Stage 3: Merge & Rank"]
        HYBRID["Hybrid score<br/>0.7*vec + 0.3*bm25"]
        MMR["MMR rerank<br/>(lambda=0.7)"]
        DECAY["Temporal decay<br/>(half-life 30d)"]
        RERANK["Route-aware<br/>reranking"]
    end

    QUERY --> STAGE1 --> STAGE2 --> STAGE3

    Q -->|"route=durable/task/recent/reference"| RERANK
```

## Promotion Path

```mermaid
flowchart TB
    subgraph PROMOTION["PROMOTION PATH"]
        P1["<b>Tier 1 → 2</b><br/>session-end signal<br/>confidence >= 0.5"]
        P2["<b>Tier 2 → 3</b><br/>3+ sessions reference same fact<br/>confidence >= 0.7"]
        P3["<b>Tier 3 → 4</b><br/>cross-project appearance<br/>manual agent flag"]
        P4["<b>Tier 4 → 5 (Archive)</b><br/>TTL expiry<br/>60d zero access_count"]
        P5["memory-archival.js<br/>enforces tier budgets<br/>writes archive-manifest.jsonl"]
    end

    P1 --> P2 --> P3 --> P4 --> P5
```

## Data Format Examples

### Structured JSONL Record

```json
{
  "id": "rec_abc123",
  "sourceKind": "claude-code",
  "memoryLevel": "session",
  "scope": "project",
  "content": "Implemented entity extraction pipeline using two-pass regex approach",
  "contentHash": "sha256:7f83b1657ff1fc53b92dc18148a1d65d",
  "confidence": 0.75,
  "tier": 2,
  "facts": [
    { "entity": "entity extraction pipeline", "type": "concept" },
    { "entity": "two-pass regex", "type": "concept" }
